The MIT licence above covers the source code of this project.

The judgment texts and expert-similarity scores in `data/raw/` are from the
dataset released with Bhattacharya, P., Ghosh, K., Pal, A., & Ghosh, S. (2022),
"Legal Case Document Similarity: You Need Both Network and Text", Information
Processing & Management 59(6) 103069, available at
https://github.com/Law-AI/document-similarity. The judgments are public-domain
Indian Supreme Court text (government works, s.52(1)(q), Copyright Act 1957);
please cite the paper if you use the dataset.

This project is an academic implementation for research and educational use.
It is not legal advice.
